  description: Twin blades that fell from the same forge and never separated. They
    snake as they fall, and the wall they draw between you and the sky bends like
    a living thing.
  tactics: 'Fires paired green walls that snake (sine motion - violet bullets). The
    wall''s gap oscillates: watch one full period before committing to a lane. The
    Hexblade itself weaves fast; it dies in three hits if you can pin it.'
